WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.533
Question nine, a number series!

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.567
One, one, two,

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:14.567
three, five, eight,

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:17.033
and then... what comes next?

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.033
A, eleven... B,

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:21.567
thirteen... C, twelve...

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.700
or D, sixteen?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.133
Five seconds!

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:33.167
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.033
The answer is...

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.700
B, thirteen! Add the two numbers

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.900
before it: five plus eight is

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.533
thirteen. That's the famous Fibonacci pattern!

00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:47.367
So, are you smart or fart?

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.133
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.767
find your rank!

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.200
So, how did you do?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.633
Comment your score below,

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:56.300
and follow for more!
